Decision: major revision

Three experts in the field have evaluated your manuscript. The fourth revie=
w was submitted in error and should be disregarded. All referees find your =
observations novel and interesting but raised three major concerns. Firstly=
, your study is purely an observational natural history report, which does =
not warrant publication as a full research article. Please change the forma=
t to a short communication. Secondly, all referees point at statistical iss=
ues. Thirdly, it is unclear why the observed animals are not identified at =
the species level. All referees provide numerous additional suggestions for=
 improving the paper. Please make good use of their suggestions when you de=
cide to resubmit the revised paper.

